  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df831e4e52b248f02149f/step-2cf1254a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a medium bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are \"popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df831e4e52b248f02149f/step-81ca0a43.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Slice haloumi horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour and a pinch of pepper. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs and mixed sesame seeds.\n• Dip haloumi slices into the flour mixture to coat, then into the egg, and finally in the breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df831e4e52b248f02149f/step-08cb04c5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the bowl with the charred corn, add shredded cabbage mix, baby spinach leaves and ranch dressing.\n• Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df831e4e52b248f02149f/step-14c424ae.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the fries have 5-10 minutes remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra oil if needed so the crumb does not stick to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df831e4e52b248f02149f/step-36c37ea2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide crumbed haloumi, sweet potato fries and charred corn slaw between plates.\n• Serve with smokey aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643df831e4e52b248f02149f/step-1f6236f5.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
